      "title": "Library Assistant (Special Collections and Archives) (Permanent)",
      "description": "Closing Date: 25/10/2026 Job Title : Library Assistant Department : Library Vacancy ID : 044483 Closing Date : 25-Oct-2026 We are seeking an enthusiastic and customer-focused individual to join our Special Collections & Archives team at Maynooth University Library. This Library Assistant role offers a unique opportunity to engage with distinctive rare books, manuscripts, and archival materials across both the John Paul II Library and the Russell Library. Working as part of a small, collaborative team, you will contribute to delivering an excellent experience for researchers, staff, students, and visitors. Library Assistant (2026) Salary Scale: €31,377 – €50,525 p.a. (15 points) Appointments will be made in accordance with public sector pay provisions. Closing Date: 23:30hrs (local Irish time) on Sunday, 25th October 2026 Applications must be submitted by the closing date and time specified above. Any applications which are still in progress at the closing time on the specified closing date will be cancelled automatically by the system. Late applications will not be accepted. Maynooth University is an equal opportunities employer The position is subject to the Statutes of the University"
